                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2832678,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "At the moment, the tech giants are simply not interested in tackling this.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 282.98,
                  "from": 278.5,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2832692,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So what is the Icelandic government doing about this?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 287.30002,
                  "from": 283.7,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2832702,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, large sums of money are being allocated to a language technology fund that it is hoped will lead to the development of Icelandic sourced apps and other social media and digital systems.",
                "meta": {
